    "turn_text": "You're going to be talking Attorney General Sessions this morning about the Justice Department and the filing of a lawsuit against California over its sanctuary city policies for undocumented immigrants. What are the, for lack of a better term, Mr. Attorney General, what are the meat and bones of your lawsuit against, is it against the feds or is it against",
